*Marco y Ancho Columna
**********************
AgregarMarco(A:&filaInicial..E:fac, 0, 0,  Exe('COLOR7'))
*AlinearCeldas(E:&filaInicial..E:fac,'C')
FormatoCeldas(C:&filaInicial..D:fac, Exe('F2'))
*FormatoCeldas(E:&filaInicial..E:fac, Exe('F2%'))

